Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.44,0:00:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had this weird feeling that there's\Nsomething important I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't remember what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do my shoes and bag feel\Nheavier than usual today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.72,0:00:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This house!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.78,0:00:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow I ended up walking all\Nthe way back to Rohan's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The door's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.84,0:00:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to drop in and thank him for\Nbeing such a great host yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'll be late for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I probably shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.98,0:00:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being an artist, he's\Nprobably still asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd be rude to just barge in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.94,0:00:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:59.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's working with such\Na chilling expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.94,0:01:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:05.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't shake the feeling that being\Nin this house is actually terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.18,0:01:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You finally made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.48,0:01:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.18,0:01:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right on time. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,0:01:16.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but could I ask you to\Nwait there for just a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two more pages and next week's\Nmanuscript will be complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.36,0:01:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll only take about 20 minutes or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.98,0:01:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he say he could finish\Ntwo pages in 20 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.98,0:01:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have misheard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He couldn't possibly draw two pages from\Nscratch in such a short amount of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're for next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we were here yesterday, he just finished\Ndrawing the manuscript for this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.56,0:01:50.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.47,0:01:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used the pen right off the bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I'm seeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:02:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he ink such complex\Ndrawings without sketching first?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.92,0:02:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.83,0:02:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's not hesitating at all and is even
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hammering out the\Nbackgrounds at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.36,0:02:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His hand movement was so quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.38,0:02:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even have a chance\Nto make out what he did!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.00,0:02:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's beta-coloring by flicking the ink\Naround like perfectly aimed shuriken,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and somehow he's not leaving\Na single stray mark behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.34,0:02:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His technique is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:38.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To beta-color without a brush takes an\Namount of skill I've never seen before!
