Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's already done?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It only took him about two minutes\Nto finish all the beta-coloring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's all thanks to you, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am overflowing with creative energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body hungers for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to keep drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.24,0:03:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finishing 19 pages in one night has\Nbeen an experience like no other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this very moment, a\Nmasterpiece is forming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.22,0:03:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life is astonishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.02,0:03:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.82,0:03:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get cracking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want the next reality from your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.94,0:03:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and show me your next page!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm aware that your weight decreases\Nwith every page I liberate,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.46,0:03:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you don't mind, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a small price to pay\Nfor becoming a masterpiece!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Immortalized for all eternity!
