Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll change you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well now!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.98,0:04:57.06,Main,Rohan,0,0,0,,{\an8}Calm down!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.98,0:04:57.06,JoJo-top,Rohan,0,0,0,,{\an8}Calm down!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.15,0:05:00.86,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(139,880)\fs60}Episode 15: {\fs80} Let's Go Visit the Mangaka's House, Part 2
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.15,0:05:00.86,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,643)\pos(139,880)\fs60}Episode 15: {\fs80} Let's Go Visit the Comics Artist's House Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.94,0:04:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's not done just yet,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.06,0:05:01.40,Main,Rohan,0,0,0,,{\an8}I have an entire volume's worth of material\N from just one of your pages!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:57.06,0:05:01.40,JoJo-top,Rohan,0,0,0,,{\an8}I have an entire volume's worth of material\N from just one of your pages!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.74,0:05:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this single panel could\Nbe a book hauled by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm maturing, both as\Na manga artist and a stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now to read this page.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.65,0:05:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless I'm mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Shining Diamond's Josuke\NHigashikata, and the Han's Okuyasu Nijimura.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.76,0:05:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would they show up on\Nmy doorstep out of the blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.04,0:05:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just no way Koichi would\Nhave mentioned me to the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but\Nit's Josuke and Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I didn't show up for school,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they must have noticed I was\Nmissing and tracked me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get them to save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.54,0:05:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can just open the door, they can\Nrush in and get me out of this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is such a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you two doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.20,0:06:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for that matter,\Nhow do you even find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.32,0:06:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke and Okuyasu don't really\Ninterest me at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now, I'll finish up the\Nlast two pages for next week,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I'll procure even\Nmore material from Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.00,0:06:26.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hardly contain myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You came here to watch a\Nmanga artist do his work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can this guy afford to\Nwork in such a nice place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan Kishibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he famous or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.24,0:06:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever heard of him, Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not that well-versed in manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, Hazamada bitched at me for\Nnot knowing anything about Perman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't even remotely close\Nto what I wanted to say to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I blanking all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we saw you staggering around, so we thought\Nit would be a good idea to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it seems like everything is Aqua.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.02,0:06:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we'll leave you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to come inside\Nand observe with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.22,0:07:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, thanks for the offer, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being around famous\Npeople makes me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.44,0:07:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same, just knowing that\Nyou weren't in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fooling around with\Nsome smoking hot chick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.14,0:07:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is enough for me, so I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later, Koichi. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I remember what I wanted to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I was trying to tell them\Nsomething really important, but what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I remember what I wanted to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I needed them to rescue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yusuke, okuyasu, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you guys at school in a bit. Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you're not late.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.92,0:07:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I wanted to say at all!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.32,0:07:49.19,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: I cannot bring harm to mangaka Kishibe Rohan.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.32,0:07:49.19,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: I cannot bring harm to comics artist Kishibe Rohan.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:49.19,0:07:52.49,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: "...cannot..." {Blu-ray edit: Consider adding a similar note in episode 14 since it does a similar zoom-in. -T}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.81,0:07:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not able to ask my friends for help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.86,0:08:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've never gone up against\Na stand this terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.80,0:08:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.06,0:08:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think we have nearly\Nenough power to beat Heaven's door.
