Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.46,0:08:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sense an infiltrator\Nhas entered the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.48,0:08:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do while you were downstairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.48,0:08:25.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.40,0:08:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.82,0:08:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep looking straight ahead, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.90,0:08:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better not try anything funny,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.80,0:08:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or I'll crush you with my\Nstand, you doodling dipshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.86,0:08:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how you\Nfigured out I was in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu, but thank goodness you're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears as though your friend\Nhad a sudden epiphany, Koichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.24,0:08:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice it before,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.52,0:08:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that small cut on your hand must have
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.76,0:08:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,given away the predicament\Nyou're currently in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.50,0:09:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You probably scratched yourself on\Nsomething while you were crawling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so focused on\Nescaping, I didn't notice!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.14,0:09:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is what gave it away, right, Okuyasu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And your stand is the hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, you have a bit of a complex\Nregarding your dead brother, Keicho.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And whenever you try to\Nmake a difficult decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you wish your brother was\Nthere to do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.94,0:09:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell told you all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak up, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.72,0:09:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Koichi, tell me everything\Nabout this guy's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.12,0:09:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's able to!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.44,0:09:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't say anything that\Nput Rohan at a disadvantage!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.04,0:09:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you catch a glimpse of\Neven one panel, it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.24,0:09:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I desperately want to\Ntell you not to look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, don't look at that manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.54,0:09:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you not to move a muscle?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you were of no concern to me at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that changed the moment\Nyou entered this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you'll serve as another of my muses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.74,0:10:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.04,0:10:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.66,0:10:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata, I know\Nyou're hiding over there.
