Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.76,0:10:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is up with\Nthis freaky-ass manga artist?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.80,0:10:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, Koichi, if you\Ndon't mind, I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you think Josuke Higashikata is\Nchoosing to remain hidden behind that door?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.20,0:10:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't he show himself, Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:10:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if I had to guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say he's laying low so he won't\Naccidentally catch a sight of your manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My thought's exactly\Nhow very astute of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okuyasu knew nothing about\Nthe power of my Heaven's Door,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.34,0:11:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he fell from my trap\Nhook, line, and sinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in doing so, he exposed the\Ntrue nature of my stand to Josuke,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.84,0:11:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,causing him to take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.62,0:11:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel that I am somewhat...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.26,0:11:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, at this point it would appear\NI'm at a significant disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I believe that Josuke has an\Nulterior motive for choosing to remain hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At any rate, this game of cat and\Nmouse has gone on long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.66,0:11:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll have to resort to other\Nmeans to smoke him out of his hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.54,0:11:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's only hiding because he wants to\Nfigure out the best way to kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.98,0:11:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're probably right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.02,0:11:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that wasn't the\Nanswer I was looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter, though, I think I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.68,0:11:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our dear hero Josuke is\Ncontemplating whether
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.94,0:11:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he should flee the mansion\Nall by his lonesome...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.62,0:12:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some friend he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.77,0:12:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke would never leave us behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.16,0:12:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right you are, Koichi. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to your files,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke Higashikata has\Nfar too much character
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.50,0:12:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to even think about abandoning you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.28,0:12:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But due to the dynamic nature\Nof a manga artist's work,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:18.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they tend to consider every\Nconceivable possibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at every conceivable moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.58,0:12:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So in the situation we\Nnow find ourselves in,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what course of action will\Nour protagonist employ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps Josuke could flee with\Nknowledge of my stand's power,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which would be quite the dilemma for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, running away might\Nbe the best thing he could do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.72,0:12:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could go and get Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if he told Yukako\Nwhat happened to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.36,0:12:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'd be angry\Nenough to help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd rather not see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we could use her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.22,0:12:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, get out of here and\Ntell them what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.98,0:12:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You imbeciles!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I explained all of that to you\Nexactly so it wouldn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.32,0:12:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I doubt you'd be so quick to prompt\NJosuke if you knew what was written in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.80,0:13:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koichi, I'm giving you my express permission\Nto explain the content of my missive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.60,0:13:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, out with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.02,0:13:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he write, Koichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.30,0:13:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he do that? It's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's completely trapped\Nus in this mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter what we do,\Nwe're never getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, that's why I'm asking what the\Nhell this sickle run on my arm, Koichi.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.86,0:13:26.11,Note,Note,0,0,0,,Note: If Higashikata Josuke brings harm to Kishibe Rohan,\N I will commit suicide by self-immolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.40,0:13:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn myself to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.36,0:13:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I said we're\Nnever getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll kill yourself if Josuke so\Nmuch as lifts a finger to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.70,0:13:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.28,0:13:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks I'll burn myself to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's total crazy talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if I'd ever do something as\Nmessed up as setting myself on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.26,0:13:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just it, you will!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.86,0:13:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're completely incapable of defying him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, right hand, knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you've come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like he really had a choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.22,0:14:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was basically dragged out of here\Nbecause he couldn't bear to hear us suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a rather childish move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But closing your eyes could be effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere to run\Nin this cramped room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he managed to knock me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heaven's Door would release its grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Okuyasu wouldn't commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.10,0:14:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Closing his eyes is simple-minded,\Nbut it just might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as he doesn't see the\Nmanuscript, Heaven's Door is powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, keep charging.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.22,0:14:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, a pretty good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all I have to do now is find\Na way to force your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's powering through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he keeps charging at\Nme like a stampeding bull,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.94,0:14:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,things are going to get very ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.82,0:14:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were a manga protagonist,\Nwhat would I do in this situation?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.95,0:14:58.71,Episode 15 Typesettng 1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\be0.6\pos(606,870)}seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.60,0:14:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would I get my enemy to open his eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.48,0:15:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repeat, think, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.88,0:15:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely something in Koichi's\Nfile will be able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.40,0:15:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.31,0:15:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly what I needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.16,0:15:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems certain comments set you\Noff, such as your hair is laughable.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.76,0:15:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or wasn't that pincushion on your\Nhead in fashion like two decades ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.70,0:15:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you think that\Nhair looks cool, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess remarks like those\Nreally do set him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit it's hard to believe,\Nbut the files are always accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a preposterous Achilles' heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just take it easy, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.58,0:15:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I dare you to insult my hair again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.24,0:15:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might think your hair looks cool,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.26,0:15:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in actuality, it may\Nbe the shittiest hairstyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.92,0:15:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've ever had the misfortune\Nof laying eyes upon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.00,0:15:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though to be fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That nest atop your useless noggin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.34,0:16:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and may come in handy should a\Npigeon come by and decide to roost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's a very strong may.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now witness heaven's door!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.24,0:16:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Point!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.04,0:16:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.70,0:16:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain his eyes were open and he\Ngot a full flash of the manuscript!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why hasn't my\Nstanzibility taken effect?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back to normal! You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I showed him the page. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did you slither off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.22,0:17:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, you punk bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I don't think he can\Nsee straight right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.90,0:17:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't see?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, are you trying to\Nsay Rohan's stupid insults?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worked him up so much that he\Ndoesn't even realize what he's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on out, you manga-obsessed asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.26,0:17:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a story for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.52,0:17:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if it's from\Na comic or someone's mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he hears any kind of hair\Ninsult, he flies into a blind rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.06,0:17:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea his temper was this bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've seen anything\Nlike this in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a facet of Josuke's personality\Nthat even Koichi knew nothing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.40,0:17:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it wasn't in his file\Nlike everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.84,0:17:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does he get so upset over his hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There has to be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.48,0:17:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever insults my hair will\Nget the full brunt of my fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:17:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for that bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.94,0:18:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.34,0:18:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive Josuke told\Nme the reason behind his
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.52,0:18:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,freak-outs when it comes to\Npeople insulting his hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.76,0:18:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's kind of an involved story.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.64,0:18:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.55,0:18:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all happened when Josuke\Nwas a little kid, and uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try to remember\Nthe story as best I can,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I might have to fill\Nin some gaps along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke was 4 years old, and he'd passed\Nout from an inexplicably high fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.16,0:18:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 50 days, no one knew\Nwhether he would live or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He found out later on that all of this\Nhappened right around the time Jotaro and Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.34,0:18:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar were in Egypt\NThey traveled there in
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.62,0:18:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,order to defeat a heinous\Nstand user named Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.68,0:18:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke's mom had no\Nidea what was happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.76,0:18:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she loaded him in the car and headed to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a hospital in S-City as fast as she could.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.74,0:18:59.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But at the time, Morioh was in the\Nmiddle of its worst blizzard in 18 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No use.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.40,0:19:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.56,0:19:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody ever uses this back road anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's not a damn payphone in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.24,0:19:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have called for an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I bring Josuke out in the snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.56,0:19:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go away, you creeper!
