Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.52,0:20:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eventually,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.01,0:20:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his mom tried to search for the young man,\Nbut she couldn't find any trace of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While the stranger may not have\Npersonally saved his life that night,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.88,0:20:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as far as four-year-old\NJosuke was concerned,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that young man he encountered was a hero\Nunlike anyone he'd ever seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.34,0:20:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He became Josuke's role\Nmodel and a shining
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,example of what it means\Nto be a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.80,0:20:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When someone insults that part of him, it\Ntriggers something deep inside his heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.94,0:20:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't know who\Nhe is or where he's from.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:21:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in honor of him coming to our\Nrescue, I decided to adopt his hairstyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one is allowed to disrespect\Nit, no matter who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disrespecting my hair\Nmeans disrespecting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.26,0:21:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I'm aware, that's the\Nreason he flies off the handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.44,0:21:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I have to admit, I thought\NJosuke was just making it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I wasn't listening very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.66,0:21:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.66,0:21:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard that story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.62,0:21:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.53,0:21:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan's holding a pen! You master!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know when to call it quits, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.50,0:21:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.41,0:21:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make sure I wrote down that\Nbeautiful story before I lost consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.44,0:21:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a tale. Bravo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.62,0:21:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had an amazing experience to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.34,0:21:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.78,0:21:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Experiences like this\Nhappen once in a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.52,0:21:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such great inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.26,0:21:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How lucky am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.92,0:21:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I packed my bags and\Nmoved to Morioh. It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.98,0:21:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as he's alive, he'll keep\Nsearching for manga material,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if he ends up battered and bruised.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.64,0:21:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, you have to\Ncommend his determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.28,0:21:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Putting aside good and bad for a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.16,0:22:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he has one of the most admirable\Nwork ethics I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.50,0:22:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rohan-sensei is truly\Na super manga artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.18,0:22:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally found you, manga artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last I checked, I wasn't\Ndone punching you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.38,0:22:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His determination is\Npretty commendable, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.88,0:22:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah.
